erson":"rensu-p0020","role":"清己奉职者；主其政者；敕令俭约者；约法供给者","evidence":["rensu-q-c49bfde0620e41b67f7c","rensu-q-8c919bcb91fb0d4e66ad","rensu-q-ea7d31effab92035b117","rensu-q-67610a484c7aca9da640"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-c49bfde0620e41b67f7c","rensu-q-8c919bcb91fb0d4e66ad","rensu-q-ea7d31effab92035b117","rensu-q-67610a484c7aca9da640"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-c49bfde0620e41b67f7c","source_order":[16,295,165],"order":3434},{"id":"hancui-e-1631b7e8e219f56ea960","title":"景初元年孟康荐崔林为公辅","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-1631b7e8e219f56ea960","label":"正文","text":"景初元年孟康荐崔林为公辅","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0020","role":"推荐","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0053","role":"被荐","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"景初元年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条明文纪年；未审定对应公元年。","evidence":["hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9","order":4922}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0020","name":"孟康","evidence":["rensu-q-667f95057ac9de8d62a5","rensu-q-d2da4d7e136e88aae831","rensu-q-c49bfde0620e41b67f7c","rensu-q-8c919bcb91fb0d4e66ad","rensu-q-ea7d31effab92035b117","rensu-q-67610a484c7aca9da640","rensu-q2-38cc86c5b784201b89f1","hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9"],"facts":[{"id":"rensu-f2-450d1391596d41c3012f","text":"《魏略》记代杜恕为弘农太守，领典农；嘉平末为勃海太守，征拜中书令，后转为监。","evidence":["rensu-q2-38cc86c5b784201b89f1"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-3389e490c7380ecf34b9","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-052318a44f11fc04586f","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年，司徒、司空并缺，散骑侍郎孟康荐林曰：“夫宰相者〖15〗，天下之所瞻效；诚宜得秉忠履正本德仗义之士，足为海内所师表者。窃见司隶校尉崔林，禀自然之正性，体高雅之弘量。论其所长以比古人：忠直不回，则史鱼之俦〖16〗；清俭守约，则季文之匹也〖17〗。牧守州郡，所在而治；及为外司〖18〗，万里肃齐〖19〗；减台辅之妙器〖20〗，衮职之良才也〖21〗。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-667f95057ac9de8d62a5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"黄初中，以于郭后有外属，并受九亲赐拜，遂转为散骑侍郎。是时，散骑皆以高才英儒充其选，而康独缘妃嫱，杂在其间，故于时皆共轻之，号为‘阿九’","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":43,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-67610a484c7aca9da640","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"郡带道路，其诸过宾客，自非公法，无所出给；若知旧造之，自出于家","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":299,"end":330,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8c919bcb91fb0d4e66ad","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"郡领吏二百余人，涉春遣休，常四分遣一；事无宿诺","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":196,"end":219,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-c49bfde0620e41b67f7c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"康到官，清己奉职，嘉善而矜不能，省息狱讼，缘民所欲，因而利之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":165,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-d2da4d7e136e88aae831","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"康既无才敏，因在冗官，博读书传；后遂有所弹驳，其文义雅而切要，众人乃更加意","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":112,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-ea7d31effab92035b117","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"时出案行，皆豫敕督邮、平水：‘不得令属官遣人探候，修设曲敬。’又不欲烦损吏民，常豫敕吏卒：‘行各持镰，所在自刈马草；不止亭传，露宿树下。’又所从常不过十余人","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":220,"end":298,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q2-38cc86c5b784201b89f1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c0fdd8c20428c596f95f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“恕在弘农，宽和有惠爱。及迁，以孟康代恕，为弘农。康字公休，安平人。黄初中，以于郭后有外属，并受九亲赐拜，遂转为散骑侍郎。是时，散骑皆以高才英儒充其选，而康独缘妃嫱，杂在其间，故于时皆共轻之，号为‘阿九’。康既无才敏，因在冗官，博读书传；后遂有所弹驳，其文义雅而切要，众人乃更加意。正始中，出为弘农，领典农校尉。康到官，清己奉职，嘉善而矜不能，省息狱讼，缘民所欲，因而利之。郡领吏二百余人，涉春遣休，常四分遣一；事无宿诺。时出案行，皆豫敕督邮、平水：‘不得令属官遣人探候，修设曲敬。’又不欲烦损吏民，常豫敕吏卒：‘行各持镰，所在自刈马草；不止亭传，露宿树下。’又所从常不过十余人。郡带道路，其诸过宾客，自非公法，无所出给；若知旧造之，自出于家。康之始拜，众人虽知共有志量，以其未尝宰牧，不保其能也；而康恩泽治能乃尔，吏民称歌焉。嘉平末，徙勃海太守。征，入为中书令，后转为监。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e1b1eadf69352ef55bf","start":0,"end":397,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
